# Power BI Dashboard Notes

## Data Model
- Source table: Sheet1 (Date, Region, Product, Salesperson, Amount)
- Dedicated Date table created and marked as the official date table, linked to Sheet1 for time intelligence.

## Core Measure
Total Sales = SUM(Sheet1[Amount])

## Visuals Built
- Table — raw summary view of sales records.
- Clustered Bar Chart — Total Sales by Region.
- Slicer — filters the whole page by Region.

